# Training runs and evaluation outputs (regenerated by `rlx train` / `rlx evaluate`) are
# ignored, except the ones behind RESULTS.md: their weights, configs, provenance and
# validation curves, and the summary tables. Training logs, per-episode CSVs and the
# per-experiment figures stay out (scripts/reproduce.py regenerates them).
runs/*
results/*
!runs/e1/
!runs/e1b_5m/
!runs/e1b_lr06/
!runs/e2_ic*/
